From: kexec diagnostics <local>
Subject: [DIAG] arm64: bounded synchronous first selected user DABT metadata

Parent: frozen KGSL nomap target4646. Requires the separate private
asm/kexec_kgsl_diag.h cache-replay API from the companion patch.
Only existing user_state=1 + chosen + active and selected roles can log.
One ordinary failed lower-EL data-abort event, original ESR/FAR/regs and
trylocked PC/LR VMA/file scalars; optional one no-fault 4-byte original PC
read only for regular readable+executable file mappings; XOM stays unread.
No FAR/data/stack access,
no pathname/ELF backing parse, hardware/PTE/SCM/callback or required worker.
Original handler, signal, registers and return/control flow are unchanged.
Best-effort diagnostic metadata/code sample, not an ownership/fatal verdict.

